sts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-27T13:08:02Z","updated_at":"2025-02-27T13:08:02Z","body":"I turned back my PR from draft to ready since the progress bar accuracy seems to be acceptable for @Calinou in the proposal.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2687914796/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2688305628","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103352#issuecomment-2688305628","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103352","id":2688305628,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gPEnc","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-27T15:29:51Z","updated_at":"2025-02-27T15:29:51Z","body":"It's nice to see progress on this! Perhaps others will have a different opinion, but I feel like the removal of `load_steps` should go in lockstep with either:\r\n- An alternative method for calculating the `load_steps` value on resource load so a progress car can be displayed. I described an approach idea in [my proposal](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11802#issue-2861019723) under the \"Describe how your proposal will work\" section, but I don't know how performant that would be.\r\n- The ability to set whether `load_steps` is included, which would default to including it. This way, users would not see the progress bar disappear and be confused or think it is a bug - they'd have to explicitly tell their project to turn off `load_steps` in order to get the better version control experience.\r\n\r\nWithout one of these options, I have a feeling we'd see a lot of people only noticing the lack of a progress bar and file a bug report for it.\r\n\r\nPerhaps it'd make sense to get this merged in as a first step for 4.5, and then we could aim to get one of the other steps done (preferably the first one, then the second one if that doesn't work out) before 4.5 releases as well, so that for most users going from 4.4 to 4.5 they wouldn't see the intermediate stage with no progress bar.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2688305628/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3503732243","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103352#issuecomment-3503732243","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103352","id":3503732243,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Q1rYT","user":{"login":"MartinDelille","id":879889,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3OTg4OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/879889?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille","html_url":"https://github.com/MartinDelille","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-07T17:11:45Z","updated_at":"2025-11-07T17:11:45Z","body":"I would like to address the issue where the progress bar disappeared but I wondered where is this progress bar displayed ? In the editor or when running a project ?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3503732243/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3514295566","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103352#issuecomment-3514295566","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103352","id":3514295566,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Rd-UO","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-10T23:15:17Z","updated_at":"2025-11-10T23:15:56Z","body":"> I would like to address the issue where the progress bar disappeared but I wondered where is this progress bar displayed ? In the editor or when running a project ?\r\n\r\nThe progress bar is displayed by [ProgressDialog](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2d86b69bf1e82f703cc0543d4309a9c8a4198585/editor/gui/progress_dialog.cpp#L1), which is controlled at a higher level by [EditorNode::progress_*()](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2d86b69bf1e82f703cc0543d4309a9c8a4198585/editor/editor_node.cpp#L5595-L5651) methods.\r\n\r\nAs a concrete example, The \"Saving Scene\" progress is shown here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2d86b69bf1e82f703cc0543d4309a9c8a4198585/editor/editor_node.cpp#L2186-L2187\r\n\r\nI don't think the editor displays a loading bar when loading individual scenes (rather than restoring previously open scenes when it's reopened). It just looks like it's freezing until the scene is done loading. This can be an issue for huge scenes, but it's one we should look into resolving separately.\r\n\r\nHowever, projects may decide to implement their own loading bar. For example, https://github.com/godotengine/tps-demo has this implemented in `menu/menu.gd`:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/tps-demo/blob/90f2e38d7b5cf9e6fd0b788d0da1df4b84d49269/menu/menu.gd#L137-L169","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3514295566/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3527869398","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103352#issuecomment-3527869398","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103352","id":3527869398,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SRwPW","user":{"login":"MartinDelille","id":879889,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3OTg4OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/879889?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille","html_url":"https://github.com/MartinDelille","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinDelille/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-13T13:39:20Z","updated_at":"2025-11-13T13:39:20Z","body":"Thanks @Calinou for providing this example!\r\n\r\nI tried visualize the issue with the tps_demo project but I can't see any difference :\r\n\r\n- before the commit (tag 4.5.1):\r\n![with_tag_4 5 1](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c9f371b5-2756-4022-af3d-dbfb948315b3)\r\n\r\n- after the commit:\r\n![with_patch_fe62426c827c32f2cbe7372c4c205c99570cc3ff](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ec961564-466f-465f-b20e-ba2f31665987)\r\n\r\nAs you can see there is no difference in the progress bar loading this big scene.\r\n\r\nIn order to restore the progress bar capability, I'd like to be able to see how I affect it.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3527869398/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3529068863","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103352#issuecomment-3529068863","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103352","id":3529068863,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SWVE_","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos